# Page subset for a scoped build. Empty = the full capture list (every page
# in the run's capture-list.txt) — the whole-site build is the default
# (ticket 07). Add one path per line (e.g. /products/license-plate-readers)
# to rebuild a single route. A scoped build still needs the captures, which are
# gone: the snapshot is frozen and there is no re-capture path (ADR 0004).
